          "documentSlug": "charter",
          "leadTitle": null,
          "bodyMarkdown": "Any person aged eighteen or older may become a Member of the Triarc by creating a verified account, declaring that they have reached that age, and affirming this charter. Verification at founding means a unique account in good standing, and the community may strengthen it by amendment. The declaration a Member makes about age is a declaration, not a check of age; when it becomes known that a Member is under eighteen, their account is closed and its personal data deleted, their public Contribution Record remains, and they may join again at eighteen.",
